# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# FLOATS_SIM
#
# Tracked:   MATLAB source (.m), COMSOL raw results (.txt), parsed sweep
#            data (.mat that is not regenerable in seconds), docs.
# Untracked: anything a script regenerates. Figures and videos are the bulk
#            of the repo by size and change on every plot re-run, so keeping
#            them out avoids a large binary diff per experiment.
#
# To keep a specific figure (e.g. one that went into a write-up), force-add
# it:  git add -f presentation/SomeFigure.png
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- regenerable figures and media ----
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
*.eps
*.svg
*.mp4
*.avi
*.gif

# ---- regenerable simulation caches ----
# These are written by plotting/comparison scripts and rebuild in seconds.
presentation/CompareDesignModels.mat
presentation/reportNumbers.mat

# ---- MATLAB working files ----
*.asv
*.m~
*.autosave
slprj/
codegen/
*.slxc
*.mex*
*.p

# ---- MATLAB / OS scratch ----
profile/
*.mlx.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- editor ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
